   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">A dirty fix would be this:<div><br><div><a href=\"https://github.com/USGS-R/EflowStats/issues/155\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/USGS-R/EflowStats/issues/155&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497929028000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1z0zeqP3g0aSzs8Nowgwiq\">https://github.com/USGS-R/EflowStats/issues/155</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>so I changed line 634 to</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">nextLocs</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(215,58,73)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">nextLocs</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,.</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">SD</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">findInterval</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">probLoc</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">sort</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cumsum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">prob</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(215,58,73)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">prob</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(215,58,73)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,92,197)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></code></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><tr style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box;width:50px;min-width:50px;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:rgba(27,31,35,0.3);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\"></td><td style=\"padding-right:10px;padding-left:10px;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:20px;vertical-align:top;overflow:visible;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;white-space:pre\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(227,98,9)\"><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(215,58,73)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#000\">id</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(227,98,9)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#606\">SDcols</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(215,58,73)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,47,98)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\">x</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,47,98)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\">y</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(3,47,98)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span><span style=\"color:#080\">prob</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)]</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></code></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div style=\"border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(187,187,187);background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><tbody style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"></tbody></table></div></code></div><br>Now it seems to run further,  even though cumsum should already be non-decreasing on its own. </div><div><br></div></div></div>"
